@@ -0,0 +1,648 @@
+# A+B+D Phase-6a Code-Quality Contract
+
+Scope: async-bash agent-runner sidecar work covering WU-A PID identity sidecar, WU-B mailbox delivery, and WU-D auto-wake coordination.
+
